## User Stories

### US-2.1: Create and maintain leagues

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** create and maintain leagues  
**So that** competitions can be organized by sport  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Create a league with a valid name and sport and verify that it is saved.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-2.2: View leagues and their sports

**As a** data user  
**I want to** view leagues and their associated sports  
**So that** I can identify the correct competition  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Open the league list and verify that each league displays its associated sport.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-2.3: Associate leagues with valid sports

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** associate each league with a valid sport  
**So that** league records remain correctly categorized  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Attempt to save a league without selecting a valid sport and verify that the system rejects it.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

